{
"id":9514891149401,
"title":"Jairo Arcila Santa Monica Washed Castillo (Wine Castillo / Lychee)",
"handle":"jairo-arcila-santa-monica-washed-castillo-wine-castillo-lychee",
"body_html":"<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><em>The <strong>Jairo Arcila Santa Monica Washed Castillo – Wine Yeast / Lychee</strong> is one of the more expressive co-fermented coffees from Finca Santa Monica.</em></p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><em>The ripe coffee cherries are carefully selected and fermented in a low-oxygen environment. During fermentation, <strong>lychee and wine yeast are added</strong>. After fermentation, the coffee is <strong>washed and dried on raised beds</strong>. That washed finish is important because it gives the coffee considerably more clarity than some of Arcila's heavier honey or natural co-ferments. <span class=\"contents\"><span class=\"\"></span></span><span class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></em></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><em>The wine yeast helps convert sugars during fermentation and contributes additional aromatic compounds, while the lychee brings a very distinctive tropical/floral character</em></p>\n<p><em><strong>Very limited. Very special. Don’t wait too long!</strong> </em></p>",
"published_at":"2026-09-24T10:09:17-04:00",
