{
"id":9514888265817,
"title":"Sebastian Gomez La Divisa Natural Gesha",
"handle":"sebastian-gomez-la-divisa-natural-gesha",
"body_html":"<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><em>If you know Gesha, you know this is a coffee worth paying attention to.</em></p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><em>Produced by Sebastián Gómez at his family farm, <strong>Finca La Divisa</strong>, in the highlands of Circasia, Quindío, Colombia, this 100% Gesha microlot represents the combination of exceptional genetics, high elevation, careful harvesting, and meticulous processing.</em></p>\n<p><em>The cherries are selectively hand-picked at peak ripeness and carefully sorted before being naturally processed and slowly dried. The result is an expressive and complex cup with beautiful floral aromatics and vibrant fruit character.</em></p>\n<p><em><strong><em>Very limited</em>. Very special. Don’t wait too long!</strong> </em></p>",
